WEBVTT

00:00:00.466 --> 00:00:07.047
Your notes are everywhere. With Révise, all your revision finally lives in one place.

00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:13.818
First, tell Révise how you like to learn, and its explanations adapt to you.

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:23.549
Drop in your PDFs, Word documents, past exam papers, and even the YouTube video of your lecture. Everything stays on your computer.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.535
Révise splits your course into chapters, and tracks what you have really mastered in each one.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:36.336
In one click, your revision sheet is ready, with definitions, formulas, and common traps.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.476
Every sentence links to the exact page of your course. One click, and you can check it.

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:47.284
Stuck on an idea? Ask for it explained as if you were twelve.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:54.867
Your flashcards come back right when you were about to forget them. And before you flip a card, say whether you're sure.

00:00:58.066 --> 00:01:02.922
A diagram in your course? Révise hides its labels, and each one becomes a card.

00:01:03.966 --> 00:01:10.645
Practice with quizzes, with hints when you're stuck. Sure of an answer that turns out wrong? That question jumps the queue.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:16.316
Sit timed mock exams. The AI grades you with a realistic marking scheme.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:24.767
Explain a concept out loud, or take a mock oral: Révise tells you what's right, what's missing, and what's wrong.

00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:29.283
Ask your course anything. Answers always cite the page.

00:01:30.433 --> 00:01:36.316
A mind map puts the whole subject on one page. Click a notion, and the course opens right beside it.

00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:42.040
To revise on the go, Révise turns your chapters into a podcast for two voices.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:49.058
Import your timetable and set your priorities: your study plan adapts, and knows what you actually did.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:57.954
Enter your weightings: Révise works out the mark you need in the final, and turns green once you've passed. Your school's subjects are often already there.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:05.300
Every morning, you know exactly what to study. And you can find anything with one shortcut, day or night.

00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:09.743
Add your friends to see when they're revising. They never see your grades.

00:02:10.933 --> 00:02:16.780
Coming from Anki or Quizlet? Import your cards. And from your phone, send a photo of the board to Révise.

00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:23.596
Everything is yours to set, and Révise updates itself, never in the middle of a mock exam.

00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:28.171
So, drop in your first course. Révise takes care of the rest.
